{"title":"urllib实战：Ajax GET请求抓取豆瓣电影数据","slug":"2024-07-26-urllib——ajax的get请求豆瓣电影","date":"2024-07-26T04:49:51.000Z","updated":"2026-05-14T05:56:56.125Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/2024-07-26-urllib——ajax的get请求豆瓣电影.json","excerpt":null,"covers":null,"content":"<h2 id=\"前言\"><a href=\"#前言\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"前言\"></a>前言</h2><p>在网络爬虫开发中，很多网站（如豆瓣）采用前后端分离的架构，数据通过 Ajax 异步加载。这意味着直接请求页面 URL 无法获取到动态渲染的电影数据，我们需要分析 Ajax 接口，直接请求 API。</p>\n<p>本文将以豆瓣电影排行榜为例，演示如何使用 Python 标准库 <code>urllib</code> 发送带参数的 GET 请求，并保存返回的 JSON 数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"目标分析\"><a href=\"#目标分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"目标分析\"></a>目标分析</h2><p>本次抓取的目标是豆瓣电影排行榜。</p>\n<p><strong>接口地址：</strong><br><code>https://movie.douban.com/j/chart/top_list</code></p>\n<p><strong>关键参数：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>type</code>: 电影类型（如 17 代表科幻片）</li>\n<li><code>interval_id</code>: 区间段（如 100:90 代表评分区间）</li>\n<li><code>start</code>: 起始索引（分页参数，从 0 开始）</li>\n<li><code>limit</code>: 每页显示数量（如 20）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\"><a href=\"#代码实现\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"代码实现\"></a>代码实现</h2><p>以下代码实现了模拟浏览器请求并下载第一页数据的功能：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br><span class=\"line\">38</span><br><span class=\"line\">39</span><br><span class=\"line\">40</span><br><span class=\"line\">41</span><br><span class=\"line\">42</span><br><span class=\"line\">43</span><br><span class=\"line\">44</span><br><span class=\"line\">45</span><br><span class=\"line\">46</span><br><span class=\"line\">47</span><br><span class=\"line\">48</span><br><span class=\"line\">49</span><br><span class=\"line\">50</span><br><span class=\"line\">51</span><br><span class=\"line\">52</span><br><span class=\"line\">53</span><br><span class=\"line\">54</span><br><span class=\"line\">55</span><br><span class=\"line\">56</span><br><span class=\"line\">57</span><br><span class=\"line\">58</span><br><span class=\"line\">59</span><br><span class=\"line\">60</span><br><span class=\"line\">61</span><br><span class=\"line\">62</span><br><span class=\"line\">63</span><br><span class=\"line\">64</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 导入urllib模块</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> urllib.request</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 1. 定义目标URL (豆瓣电影Ajax接口)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 参数说明：type=17(科幻), interval_id=100:90, start=0, limit=20</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">url = <span class=\"string\">&#x27;https://movie.douban.com/j/chart/top_list?type=17&amp;interval_id=100%3A90&amp;action=&amp;start=0&amp;limit=20&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 2. 构造请求头</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 豆瓣会检查User-Agent，必须伪装成浏览器，否则会返回403错误</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">headers = &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"string\">&#x27;User-Agent&#x27;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&#x27;Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/58.0.3029.110 Safari/537.3&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 3. 构建请求对象</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 使用Request对象封装URL和Headers，这是处理复杂请求的标准方式</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">req = urllib.request.Request(url=url, headers=headers)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 4. 发送请求并获取响应</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">try</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    res = urllib.request.urlopen(req)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 读取响应内容并解码为utf-8字符串</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    html = res.read().decode(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;utf-8&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 5. 数据持久化存储</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 将获取的JSON字符串写入本地文件</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">with</span> <span class=\"built_in\">open</span>(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;douban.json&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;w&#x27;</span>, encoding=<span class=\"string\">&#x27;utf-8&#x27;</span>) <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> f:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        f.write(html)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;豆瓣电影数据下载完成，已保存为 douban.json&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">except</span> urllib.error.URLError <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> e:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;请求发生错误: <span class=\"subst\">&#123;e.reason&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 核心技术点解析</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 1. UA 伪装</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">豆瓣具有基础的反爬机制。如果请求头中不包含 `User-Agent`，服务器会识别请求为爬虫脚本并拒绝访问。代码中通过定义 `headers` 字典并传入 `Request` 对象来实现伪装：</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```python</span><br><span class=\"line\">req = urllib.request.Request(url=url, headers=headers)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 2. Ajax 接口特性</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">与请求普通 HTML 页面不同，Ajax 接口直接返回 JSON 格式的数据。</span><br><span class=\"line\">*   **URL 特点**：通常以 `/j/` 开头或返回数据非 HTML。</span><br><span class=\"line\">*   **数据解析**：获取到的 `html` 变量实际上是 JSON 字符串，后续可使用 `json.loads(html)` 解析为 Python 字典进行深度清洗。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 3. 编码处理</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">网络传输的数据为字节流，必须调用 `decode(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;utf-8&#x27;</span>)` 将其解码为字符串，否则写入文件后会出现乱码或无法阅读的情况。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 运行结果</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">运行脚本后，本地目录下会生成 `douban.json` 文件，内容结构如下所示：</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```json</span><br><span class=\"line\">[</span><br><span class=\"line\">  &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"string\">&quot;rating&quot;</span>: [<span class=\"string\">&quot;9.4&quot;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;50&quot;</span>],</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"string\">&quot;rank&quot;</span>: <span class=\"number\">1</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"string\">&quot;cover_url&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;https://...&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"string\">&quot;title&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;星际穿越&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    ...</span><br><span class=\"line\">  &#125;,</span><br><span class=\"line\">  ...</span><br><span class=\"line\">]</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 总结</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">本文介绍了使用 `urllib` 抓取 Ajax 数据的基础方法。相比第三方库 `requests`，`urllib` 作为标准库无需安装，适合轻量级的数据抓取任务。但在处理 Cookies 或复杂参数时，推荐进一步学习 `urllib.parse` 或改用 `requests` 库。</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>","more":"<h2 id=\"前言\"><a href=\"#前言\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"前言\"></a>前言</h2><p>在网络爬虫开发中，很多网站（如豆瓣）采用前后端分离的架构，数据通过 Ajax 异步加载。这意味着直接请求页面 URL 无法获取到动态渲染的电影数据，我们需要分析 Ajax 接口，直接请求 API。</p>\n<p>本文将以豆瓣电影排行榜为例，演示如何使用 Python 标准库 <code>urllib</code> 发送带参数的 GET 请求，并保存返回的 JSON 数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"目标分析\"><a href=\"#目标分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"目标分析\"></a>目标分析</h2><p>本次抓取的目标是豆瓣电影排行榜。</p>\n<p><strong>接口地址：</strong><br><code>https://movie.douban.com/j/chart/top_list</code></p>\n<p><strong>关键参数：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>type</code>: 电影类型（如 17 代表科幻片）</li>\n<li><code>interval_id</code>: 区间段（如 100:90 代表评分区间）</li>\n<li><code>start</code>: 起始索引（分页参数，从 0 开始）</li>\n<li><code>limit</code>: 每页显示数量（如 20）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\"><a href=\"#代码实现\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"代码实现\"></a>代码实现</h2><p>以下代码实现了模拟浏览器请求并下载第一页数据的功能：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br><span class=\"line\">38</span><br><span class=\"line\">39</span><br><span class=\"line\">40</span><br><span class=\"line\">41</span><br><span class=\"line\">42</span><br><span class=\"line\">43</span><br><span class=\"line\">44</span><br><span class=\"line\">45</span><br><span class=\"line\">46</span><br><span class=\"line\">47</span><br><span class=\"line\">48</span><br><span class=\"line\">49</span><br><span class=\"line\">50</span><br><span class=\"line\">51</span><br><span class=\"line\">52</span><br><span class=\"line\">53</span><br><span class=\"line\">54</span><br><span class=\"line\">55</span><br><span class=\"line\">56</span><br><span class=\"line\">57</span><br><span class=\"line\">58</span><br><span class=\"line\">59</span><br><span class=\"line\">60</span><br><span class=\"line\">61</span><br><span class=\"line\">62</span><br><span class=\"line\">63</span><br><span class=\"line\">64</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 导入urllib模块</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> urllib.request</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 1. 定义目标URL (豆瓣电影Ajax接口)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 参数说明：type=17(科幻), interval_id=100:90, start=0, limit=20</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">url = <span class=\"string\">&#x27;https://movie.douban.com/j/chart/top_list?type=17&amp;interval_id=100%3A90&amp;action=&amp;start=0&amp;limit=20&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 2. 构造请求头</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 豆瓣会检查User-Agent，必须伪装成浏览器，否则会返回403错误</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">headers = &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"string\">&#x27;User-Agent&#x27;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&#x27;Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/58.0.3029.110 Safari/537.3&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 3. 构建请求对象</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 使用Request对象封装URL和Headers，这是处理复杂请求的标准方式</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">req = urllib.request.Request(url=url, headers=headers)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 4. 发送请求并获取响应</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">try</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    res = urllib.request.urlopen(req)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 读取响应内容并解码为utf-8字符串</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    html = res.read().decode(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;utf-8&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 5. 数据持久化存储</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 将获取的JSON字符串写入本地文件</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">with</span> <span class=\"built_in\">open</span>(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;douban.json&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;w&#x27;</span>, encoding=<span class=\"string\">&#x27;utf-8&#x27;</span>) <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> f:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        f.write(html)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;豆瓣电影数据下载完成，已保存为 douban.json&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">except</span> urllib.error.URLError <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> e:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;请求发生错误: <span class=\"subst\">&#123;e.reason&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 核心技术点解析</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 1. UA 伪装</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">豆瓣具有基础的反爬机制。如果请求头中不包含 `User-Agent`，服务器会识别请求为爬虫脚本并拒绝访问。代码中通过定义 `headers` 字典并传入 `Request` 对象来实现伪装：</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```python</span><br><span class=\"line\">req = urllib.request.Request(url=url, headers=headers)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 2. Ajax 接口特性</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">与请求普通 HTML 页面不同，Ajax 接口直接返回 JSON 格式的数据。</span><br><span class=\"line\">*   **URL 特点**：通常以 `/j/` 开头或返回数据非 HTML。</span><br><span class=\"line\">*   **数据解析**：获取到的 `html` 变量实际上是 JSON 字符串，后续可使用 `json.loads(html)` 解析为 Python 字典进行深度清洗。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 3. 编码处理</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">网络传输的数据为字节流，必须调用 `decode(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;utf-8&#x27;</span>)` 将其解码为字符串，否则写入文件后会出现乱码或无法阅读的情况。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 运行结果</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">运行脚本后，本地目录下会生成 `douban.json` 文件，内容结构如下所示：</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```json</span><br><span class=\"line\">[</span><br><span class=\"line\">  &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"string\">&quot;rating&quot;</span>: [<span class=\"string\">&quot;9.4&quot;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;50&quot;</span>],</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"string\">&quot;rank&quot;</span>: <span class=\"number\">1</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"string\">&quot;cover_url&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;https://...&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"string\">&quot;title&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;星际穿越&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    ...</span><br><span class=\"line\">  &#125;,</span><br><span class=\"line\">  ...</span><br><span class=\"line\">]</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 总结</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">本文介绍了使用 `urllib` 抓取 Ajax 数据的基础方法。相比第三方库 `requests`，`urllib` 作为标准库无需安装，适合轻量级的数据抓取任务。但在处理 Cookies 或复杂参数时，推荐进一步学习 `urllib.parse` 或改用 `requests` 库。</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>","categories":[{"name":"Python爬虫","path":"api/categories/Python爬虫.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"Python","path":"api/tags/Python.json"},{"name":"Spider","path":"api/tags/Spider.json"},{"name":"urllib","path":"api/tags/urllib.json"},{"name":"Ajax","path":"api/tags/Ajax.json"}]}